      "purpose": "A service-program module (Ctl-Opt Nomain) that wraps the IBM i QDBRTVFD (Retrieve File Description) API and exposes it as an SQL User-Defined Function (UDF). The single exported procedure SQLRTVFD accepts a file name, library, and a field-name token, calls QDBRTVFD via ExtPgm, then inspects the returned FILD0100 format data structure to return a Char(10) value describing file attributes such as type (PHYSICAL/LOGICAL), file type (*SRC/*DATA), maintenance, authority, max/current members, CCSID, reuse-deleted-records flag, and access-path size.",
